# Material Design best practices

When designing or implementing UI with MUI, theme tokens, layout, elevation, motion, or Material Design:

1. Read and follow [`.agents/skills/material-design-best-practices/SKILL.md`](../../.agents/skills/material-design-best-practices/SKILL.md).
2. Prefer MUI `sx`, palette, and layout tokens from `src/theme/muiTheme.ts` (see [docs/conventions.md](../../docs/conventions.md)); do not introduce Tailwind or another UI library.
